hy does $(0,1)$ have no minimum?","options":["It has no lower bounds.","No element of $(0,1)$ is smallest.","It contains $0$.","It contains exactly one point."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"47fd297dd688d0a5b568dade"},{"id":"expansion_pack_047_minimum_of_a_set_add_008","difficulty":"standard","question_type":"application","question":"For $E=(0,3]$, which statement is correct?","options":["$\\min E=0$, the left endpoint","$E$ has no minimum.","$\\min E=3$.","$\\min E=1$."],"answer_mode":"server","feedback_revision":"cdbd185744030ef016c92f07"}]}}